- **Pick-up Location**: Kaseya Center, 601 Biscayne Blvd, Miami, FL 33132 (Google Place ID: ChIJlZFyCaC22YgRbFtPKFIFrRM).
- **Drop-off Location**: Miami International Airport (MIA), Miami, FL (Google Place ID: ChIJwUq5Tk232YgR4fiiy-Dan5g).
