#### 3. Hotel Recommendation Within 30 km of Orlando International Airport (MCO)
- **Search Parameters**: Hotels around MCO coordinates (Latitude: 28.4313, Longitude: -81.3084); arrival November 30, 2024; departure December 1, 2024 (one night for example); 1 room, 1 adult; radius 30 km; no price filters initially.
