#### 4. Fun Places (Attractions) Around the Recommended Hotel
- **Search Parameters**: Popular attractions near Magic Moment Resort and Kids Club (hotel ID: 1636512).
- **Highlights** (distances from hotel; all within ~5 km for easy access via taxi/Uber ~$10-20 each way):
