This plan gets you to Orlando efficiently for your vacation. Total estimated cost (taxi + flight + hotel + airport taxi): ~$250-300 for one night. If you need bookings, more options (e.g., earlier flights, different hotel dates, or group sizes), or adjustments (e.g., specific budget or attractions), just let me know! Safe travels!

